630	/// What the office reimburses for one damaged item: the damage amount less the
631	/// deductible. The office charges the deductible per damage event, and it
632	/// counts each damaged item as a damage event of its own -- two items damaged
633	/// by a single dragon attack bear the deductible twice, once each.
634	fn reimbursement_of(damaged_item: &Item, damage: &Damage) -> i64 {
635	    reimbursable_damage_of(damaged_item, damage) - DEDUCTIBLE
636	}
